    "body": "#### vim-patch:800e01d: runtime(sshconfig): Fix a letter case typo in syntax script\n\nrelated: vim/vim#21390\n\nhttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/800e01d94b23d3729f588b6755db59abc86b1eef\n\nCo-authored-by: Rochish Manda <28740792+Rochish-Manda@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n\n#### vim-patch:10b37ab: runtime(sshdconfig): Fix a letter case typo in syntax script\n\ncloses: vim/vim#21390\n\nhttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/10b37abb11578db7efe1abeb0d864e264a316342\n\nCo-authored-by: Rochish Manda <28740792+Rochish-Manda@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n\n#### vim-patch:d1fa936: runtime(javascript): missing :endif in javascriptcomplete#CompleteJS()\n\nProblem:  The \"if a:findstart\" block in javascriptcomplete#CompleteJS()\n          has no matching :endif.\nSolution: Add the missing :endif before :endfunction.\n\nThis has no user-visible effect.  Both branches of the block return\nbefore reaching :endfunction, so calling the function never gives\nE171 and completion works as before.\n\ncloses: vim/vim#21388\n\nhttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/d1fa9362243c74a8c41a5a743836619e6157881a\n\nCo-authored-by: Hirohito Higashi <h.east.727@gmail.com>\n\n\n#### vim-patch:f4eeed1: runtime(sshallowedsigners): update syntax script\n\nrelated: vim/vim#21387\n\nhttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/f4eeed11a578497cdb830bc4013a1931005b06d2\n\nCo-authored-by: Eisuke Kawashima <e-kwsm@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n\n#### vim-patch:a3f2359: runtime(sshauthorizedkeys): update syntax and add syntax test\n\nrelated: vim/vim#21387\n\nhttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/a3f2359af7cda5498ca7b28176c73a5e42df96de\n\nCo-authored-by: Eisuke Kawashima <e-kwsm@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n\n#### vim-patch:607da33: runtime(sshconfig): update syntax script and add syntax test\n\nrelated: vim/vim#21387\n\nhttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/607da3321233e46269e98f0d9d1a766056054e54\n\nCo-authored-by: Eisuke Kawashima <e-kwsm@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n\n#### vim-patch:ce07f01: runtime(sshdconfig): update syntax script\n\nrelated: vim/vim#21387\n\nhttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/ce07f0187a96061092da12b2e31100a54ae22aba\n\nCo-authored-by: Eisuke Kawashima <e-kwsm@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n\n#### vim-patch:ca0610c: runtime(sshpublickey): update syntax script and add syntax test\n\nrelated: vim/vim#21387\n\nhttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/ca0610c14f11e75d720fbe0cc17d645b30d768a4\n\nCo-authored-by: Eisuke Kawashima <e-kwsm@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n\n#### vim-patch:10d1ef0: runtime(sshknownhosts): update syntax script and add syntax test\n\ncloses: vim/vim#21387\n\nhttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/10d1ef03fe2931999af5fd571f0cd0e4dc32027b\n\nCo-authored-by: Eisuke Kawashima <e-kwsm@users.noreply.github.com>",
